<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Contal '96 net rises 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Contal '96 net rises 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bottler Grupo Continental SA on Monday reported earnings per share of 2.28 pesos for 1996, according to preliminary figures that have yet to be officially announced and sent to the Mexican Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Net profits rose 20 percent to 341.6 million pesos, according to the figures.</p>
<p>The data were obtained by Reuters. No comparative figures were available.</p>
<p>((-- Daniel Perez-Whitaker, Monterrey Bureau 528 3457617))</p>
